{
  "info": {
    "name": "EcoleDigitale - Soumission Devoir Activite 2",
    "description": "Collection pour soumettre le devoir 'Activite 2' par Célestin Kacou",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Upload PDF File",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Tenant",
            "value": "imhotepacademy",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Dev-Auth",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "536a5c76-0de7-4d6f-8065-e09778566066",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": [],
              "description": "Select your PDF file here (max 10 MB)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1/assignments/91ccfb83-77bc-4df3-bb28-48ebc52e1a07/submissions/upload",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "4000",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "assignments",
            "91ccfb83-77bc-4df3-bb28-48ebc52e1a07",
            "submissions",
            "upload"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Upload le fichier PDF. Cette requête va:\n1. Créer automatiquement une soumission dans la table assignment_submissions\n2. Uploader le fichier\n3. Retourner un submissionId à utiliser dans l'étape 2\n\nRÉPONSE ATTENDUE:\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"submissionId\": \"uuid-here\",\n    \"fileUrl\": \"/api/v1/files/...\",\n    \"status\": \"in_progress\"\n  }\n}"
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Sauvegarder automatiquement le submissionId",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data.submissionId) {",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"submissionId\", jsonData.data.submissionId);",
              "        console.log(\"✅ Submission ID saved:\", jsonData.data.submissionId);",
              "    }",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Finalize Submission",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Tenant",
            "value": "imhotepacademy",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Dev-Auth",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "536a5c76-0de7-4d6f-8065-e09778566066",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"confirm_submit\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1/assignments/4db4dfd7-27e8-4793-b5cd-37a126c3a89d/submissions/{{submissionId}}/finalize",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "4000",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "assignments",
            "4db4dfd7-27e8-4793-b5cd-37a126c3a89d",
            "submissions",
            "{{submissionId}}",
            "finalize"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Finalise la soumission. Le {{submissionId}} sera automatiquement rempli si vous avez exécuté l'étape 1.\n\nCette requête va:\n1. Vérifier que la soumission existe\n2. Marquer le status comme 'submitted'\n3. Enregistrer submitted_at\n4. Vérifier si c'est en retard (is_late)\n\nRÉPONSE ATTENDUE:\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Soumission finalisée avec succès\",\n  \"submission\": {\n    \"id\": \"uuid\",\n    \"status\": \"submitted\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2025-10-08T...\",\n    \"is_late\": false\n  }\n}"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Verify Submission",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "X-Tenant",
            "value": "imhotepacademy",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Dev-Auth",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-User-Id",
            "value": "536a5c76-0de7-4d6f-8065-e09778566066",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1/student/assignments",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "4000",
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "student",
            "assignments"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Vérifie que la soumission a été enregistrée.\n\nCherchez dans la réponse:\n- instance_id: 91ccfb83-77bc-4df3-bb28-48ebc52e1a07\n- title: Activité 2\n- submitted_at: devrait avoir une date (pas null)\n- status: devrait être \"submitted\""
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "submissionId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}

